To prove this, we set $ \mathcal{C}(n)\triangleq\big\{\rho-\frac{2(1-\rho)}{9}<\hat{\rho}(\hat{\alpha} n)\big\}$ and $\mathcal{D}(n)\triangleq\mathcal{D}_{1}(n)\cap \mathcal{D}_{2}(n)$ where
\begin{align}
